{
  "quest.74EBD1E63235A9E7.title": "&dBound Essence",
  "quest.686C88AC0EAC0580.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aStellar Charts&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aBeast Mind&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.0F00A9F0A7B3E5AB.title": "&9Antimatter",
  "quest.271D33449195EF70.title": "&cPhase Four: The Heart",
  "quest.3AD6C1611BE808AC.title": "&cFeed The Beast",
  "quest.6AA6C01368D6E51F.quest_desc": [
    "&aRune Plates&r are brewed in a &eWitchery&r &2Cauldron&r, two per brew. The brew draws 1,000 power from a nearby &2Altar&r.",
    "",
    "&aPurified Vinteum Dust&r needs &2Cerublossom&r and Desert Nova. Grow them in an &eLTX&r &aBio/ARU Garden&r or an &eFTB Industrial Contraptions&r &2Hydroponic Accelerator&r instead of picking them by hand.",
  ],
  "quest.207C8D7ECDE970C7.title": "&bLogic Lattice",
  "quest.0F00A9F0A7B3E5AB.quest_desc": [
    "Fuel Cores are made in the &eLTX&r &2Assembler&r, and each craft takes &aAntimatter&r.",
    "",
    "Antimatter comes from the &eFTB Industrial Contraptions&r &aAntimatter Constructor&r, which takes a great deal of power for every piece. Feeding it &aScrap&r or &2Scrap Boxes&r speeds it up.",
  ],
  "quest.3ED3A5C17426409C.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aStorage Matrices&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aCognition Array&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.75377F96CF3D0542.quest_desc": [
    "&aBound Essence&r is made in a &eNeo Vitae&r &2Hellfire Forge&r, two per craft. The forge drains demon will, so keep a large supply nearby.",
  ],
  "quest.3424B583F08C904E.title": "&9Charge Cell",
  "quest.43254C6DA652CD80.quest_desc": [
    "To make a &aBeast Soul&r, you need the &2Soul Covenant&r, the Causal Anchor and the Arcane Codex. Launch one through the &6FTB Skyline&r.",
  ],
  "quest.6AA6C01368D6E51F.title": "&dRune Carving",
  "quest.28F13C084F290510.title": "&bCausal Anchor",
  "quest.0F938273B444DCC6.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aLiving Cultures&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aBeast Core&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.3865D1981A6C504A.quest_desc": [
    "&aHunter's Marks&r are made in &eEnder IO&r's &2Slice'N'Splice&r, two per craft.",
    "",
    "&cWarning&r: use an empty &aVoid Tear&r. One that holds items is used up along with everything stored in it.",
  ],
  "quest.2BE12C77F5A3B217.title": "&9Charged Up",
  "quest.66DA6CCD0EE57AF2.title": "&dArcane Codex",
  "quest.378515D4213D1BA9.quest_desc": [
    "The &aHunt Standard&r is the Hunt quest's component. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes two per craft once the boss trials are done.",
    "",
    "It goes into the &aStellar Chart&r and the &2Abyssal Lens&r later, and the &cHeart of the Beast&r asks for it again.",
  ],
  "quest.53B6E5AE4FF4A857.title": "&cBeast Mind",
  "quest.596C7FC9FD418D10.quest_desc": [
    "A &aDragon Relic&r is cast on a &eHephaestus&r &2Seared Casting Table&r. The &aDragon Bone&r takes the place of the cast and is used up, then &2Molten Fire Dragonsteel&r is poured over it.",
    "",
    "Melt &aFire Dragonsteel Ingots&r in the smeltery to get the molten metal.",
  ],
  "quest.58087F42E353F1A7.title": "&dThe Soul Industry",
  "quest.58087F42E353F1A7.quest_desc": [
    "The &aSoul Covenant&r draws on five magic mods at once, from &eNeo Vitae&r blood work to &eAnima&r crystals.",
    "",
    "An upgraded &aPromise&r doesn't stack, so keep one ready for each craft.",
  ],
  "quest.11523CC5811E7A35.quest_desc": [
    "Your first assembly, the &aBeast Core&r, takes the &2Living Culture&r, the Abyssal Lens and Ultradense Antimatter. Launch one through the &6FTB Skyline&r.",
  ],
  "quest.2754B03A1C3C9790.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aFuel Cores&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aDynamo Matrix&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.524F093A735BE7DD.quest_desc": [
    "The &6FTB Fabricator&r is the first step towards the pack's main goal.",
    "",
    "It makes the &6FTB Skyline&r &oand&r every Feed The Beast component from the path components all the way up to the &cHeart of the Beast&r.",
    "",
    "It runs on power and takes up to nine ingredients and two fluids at once. You never pick a recipe. Fill the input buffer and the Fabricator starts whichever recipe matches.",
    "",
    "The Fabricator takes its power every tick. If the buffer runs short, the craft stops until power comes back, so the late recipes need cables and storage that keep up with their draw.",
  ],
  "quest.6657769447DCC151.quest_desc": [
    "&aLogic Lattices&r are made in &eExtendedAE&r's &2Crystal Assembler&r, two per craft.",
    "",
    "&eRefined Storage&r's &aAdvanced Processors&r and &eAE2&r's &2Engineering Processors&r both work. Choose the AE2 route if you run AE2, since it takes half as many processors.",
  ],
  "quest.1AF9F40BC39B15E7.title": "&dSoul Covenant",
  "quest.783B31D7CB5FECF3.quest_desc": [
    "For the second trial, kill either the &aThunder King&r or the &2FrostBear&r. Either one completes the quest.",
  ],
  "quest.1680E39D555B6F9D.quest_desc": [
    "The &aCausal Anchor&r needs &eJust Dire Things&r' time crystals and machinery, &eOritech&r's &2Tachyon Absorber&r and the &eLTX&r Nova.",
    "",
    "&aTime Crystals&r grow from a Time Crystal budding block, so set one up early.",
  ],
  "quest.303158D55BB8EB0A.quest_desc": [
    "The last trial is a magical boss. Any &eArs Magica&r guardian counts, and so do &eWitchery&r's Death, Gulg, Horned Huntsman, Leonard and Mog.",
    "",
    "Completing this quest unlocks the &aHunt Standard&r recipe in the &6FTB Fabricator&r.",
  ],
  "quest.32BF6878128A4A41.quest_desc": [
    "The &aCognition Array&r is the logistics quest path's path component. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes two per craft.",
    "",
    "The &aStellar Chart&r, the &2Living Culture&r and the Beast Mind all use it later.",
  ],
  "quest.53B6E5AE4FF4A857.quest_desc": [
    "A &aBeast Mind&r takes the &2Stellar Chart&r, the Causal Anchor and the Cognition Array. Launch one through the &6FTB Skyline&r.",
  ],
  "quest.547E150FD212CE6A.quest_desc": [
    "&aStorage Matrices&r are made in &eAdvancedAE&r's &2Reaction Chamber&r with Menril Resin, two per craft.",
    "",
    "A &eRefined Storage&r &a64k Storage Part&r or an &eAE2&r &216k ME Storage Component&r both work. The AE2 recipe makes three.",
  ],
  "quest.32BF6878128A4A41.title": "&bCognition Array",
  "quest.28F13C084F290510.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aCausal Anchors&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. Both the &aBeast Mind&r and the &2Beast Soul&r use them, so make extra.",
  ],
  "quest.75377F96CF3D0542.title": "&dBound in Fire",
  "quest.783B31D7CB5FECF3.title": "&3Storm or Frost",
  "quest.4E1BD5A8A30FD48F.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aHunter's Marks&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. Make spares, since the &aHunt Standard&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.378515D4213D1BA9.title": "&3Hunt Standard",
  "quest.3CEEE30B0E586B61.title": "&6Quantum Alloy Lattice",
  "quest.303158D55BB8EB0A.title": "&3An Arcane Foe",
  "quest.27EC7598ED066BB9.title": "&cPhase Two: Combinations",
  "quest.337013B1E6098B0F.title": "&9Beyond the Atmosphere",
  "quest.51090593521196EA.title": "&dRune Plate",
  "quest.7B97384DD7B5F13A.quest_desc": [
    "The &aHunt Standard&r recipe stays locked until your team has proven itself against three bosses. The first is the &aWither&r.",
    "",
    "Kill a Wither. The next trials unlock one after another below this quest.",
  ],
  "quest.51090593521196EA.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aRune Plates&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aArcane Codex&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.3CEEE30B0E586B61.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aQuantum Alloy Lattices&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aTectonic Ingot&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.74EBD1E63235A9E7.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aBound Essence&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aArcane Codex&r uses it too.",
  ],
  "quest.41767899815ED603.title": "&9Dynamo Matrix",
  "quest.11523CC5811E7A35.title": "&cBeast Core",
  "quest.524F093A735BE7DD.title": "&6The FTB Fabricator",
  "quest.4E1BD5A8A30FD48F.title": "&3Hunter's Mark",
  "quest.68CD3FB4B9D3E73C.title": "&6Pressure at Depth",
  "quest.67653968F82D7015.quest_desc": [
    "&aComposite Hull Plating&r is put together in the &eOritech&r &2Assembler&r, two per craft. Every input is a full block or an alloy, so set up storage for them.",
  ],
  "quest.369A794CDF251519.title": "&3Dragon Relic",
  "quest.68CD3FB4B9D3E73C.quest_desc": [
    "Most of the &aAbyssal Lens&r comes from &eNautec&r's deep-sea work.",
    "",
    "The &aLaser Channeling Coil&r comes from a laser transformation of a &2Burnt Coil&r. The &aKraken Shell&r doesn't stack, so the recipe asks for one at a time.",
  ],
  "quest.2BE12C77F5A3B217.quest_desc": [
    "&aCharge Cells&r are made in a &ePowah&r &2Energizing Orb&r. Each one takes 20,000,000 FE, and the rods around the orb set how fast it goes.",
  ],
  "quest.56B9F00E1A03D9E5.quest_desc": [
    "The &aTectonic Ingot&r is the material quest path's path component. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes two per craft.",
    "",
    "Make plenty. Three combinations and the &cHeart of the Beast&r all use it, more than any other path component.",
  ],
  "quest.369A794CDF251519.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aDragon Relics&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. Make spares for the &aHunt Standard&r.",
  ],
  "quest.6657769447DCC151.title": "&bLattice Work",
  "quest.1AF9F40BC39B15E7.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aSoul Covenants&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aBeast Soul&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.7E2819AC0B02950E.quest_desc": [
    "&aQuantum Alloy Lattices&r are made in the &eLTX&r &2Arc Furnace&r with lava, two per craft.",
  ],
  "quest.763DA227802CAF6B.quest_desc": [
    "All five combinations are done. Claim this quest to unlock the &aBeast Core&r, &2Beast Mind&r and Beast Soul recipes.",
    "",
    "Each assembly draws 5,000,000 FE per tick for a minute.",
  ],
  "quest.686C88AC0EAC0580.title": "&9Stellar Chart",
  "quest.57A4691609E10D24.quest_desc": [
    "The Beast is never full for long. Launch two of each path component and one of each combination through the &6FTB Skyline&r to pick a reward.",
    "",
    "This quest repeats, so a running factory can keep paying out.",
  ],
  "quest.67653968F82D7015.title": "&6Hull Stock",
  "quest.7E2819AC0B02950E.title": "&6Arc Alloys",
  "quest.56B9F00E1A03D9E5.title": "&6Tectonic Ingot",
  "quest.523CFE289E14A7F4.title": "&6Composite Hull Plating",
  "quest.27EC7598ED066BB9.quest_desc": [
    "All five path components are done. Claim this quest to unlock the five combination recipes in the &6FTB Fabricator&r.",
    "",
    "Each combination draws 1,000,000 FE per tick for a minute.",
  ],
  "quest.596C7FC9FD418D10.title": "&3Dragon Relics",
  "quest.66DA6CCD0EE57AF2.quest_desc": [
    "The &aArcane Codex&r is the sorcery quest path's path component. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes two per craft.",
    "",
    "The &aSoul Covenant&r, the &2Causal Anchor&r and the Beast Soul all use it later.",
  ],
  "quest.0F938273B444DCC6.title": "&aLiving Culture",
  "quest.523CFE289E14A7F4.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aComposite Hull Plating&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aTectonic Ingot&r uses it too.",
  ],
  "quest.271D33449195EF70.quest_desc": [
    "All three assemblies are done. Claim this quest to unlock the &cHeart of the Beast&r recipe.",
    "",
    "The Heart draws 40,000,000 FE per tick for three minutes.",
  ],
  "quest.3ED3A5C17426409C.title": "&bStorage Matrix",
  "quest.6DDEFBD9C262AA0B.title": "&aFeed the Factories",
  "quest.3AD6C1611BE808AC.quest_desc": [
    "The &aHeart of the Beast&r brings every quest path together.",
    "",
    "Deliver the Heart, fill the fluid and energy bays, and press &aLaunch&r to finish the chapter.",
    "",
    "Your team gets the &aBeast Trophy&r and its first creative items, and every member can claim a hat they don't own yet.",
    "",
    "&7&oCongratulations, and thank you for playing FTB Evolution 2.&r",
  ],
  "quest.6DDEFBD9C262AA0B.quest_desc": [
    "The &aLiving Culture&r joins three path components with the &eLTX&r &2Real Virtuality Processor&r and other mods' alloys.",
    "",
    "&aSuperconductors&r need &2Crystallized Lapis Lazuli&r. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes it 32 at a time, much faster than growing it, at a higher cost.",
  ],
  "quest.531E1581CAA5AF16.title": "&6Abyssal Lens",
  "quest.531E1581CAA5AF16.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aAbyssal Lenses&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aBeast Core&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.207C8D7ECDE970C7.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aLogic Lattices&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aCognition Array&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.41767899815ED603.quest_desc": [
    "The &aDynamo Matrix&r is the power quest path's path component. The &6FTB Fabricator&r makes two per craft, and it takes more &aAntimatter&r.",
    "",
    "The &aLiving Culture&r, the &2Soul Covenant&r and the Beast Core all use it later.",
  ],
  "task.15CF6042AC24DDB1.title": "&aAdvanced Processor&r or &aEngineering Processor&r",
  "quest.2905D04F590BAC36.title": "&6FTB Skyline",
  "quest.43254C6DA652CD80.title": "&cBeast Soul",
  "quest.3424B583F08C904E.quest_desc": [
    "Launch &aCharge Cells&r through the &6FTB Skyline&r. The &aDynamo Matrix&r uses them too.",
  ],
  "quest.547E150FD212CE6A.title": "&bMatrix Parts",
  "quest.3865D1981A6C504A.title": "&3Trophies of the Hunt",
  "quest.763DA227802CAF6B.title": "&cPhase Three: Assemblies",
  "quest.7B97384DD7B5F13A.title": "&3The First Trial",
  "task.26E9F8319109DD27.title": "&a64k Storage Part&r or &a16k ME Storage Component&r",
  "quest.1680E39D555B6F9D.title": "&bAgainst Causality",
  "quest.2905D04F590BAC36.quest_desc": [
    "This is &6FTB Evolution 2's&r end game.",
    "",
    "To &claunch&r all of the challenges for the &6Skyline&r, you'll need to experience almost every mod in the pack.",
    "",
    "You'll deliver everything by pumping it into the &6Skyline&r. It needs a clear 5 by 5 area, 6 blocks tall, view of the sky, and only your team can use it.",
    "",
    "- &aItems&r: the bays on the console side and the back.",
    "- &aFluids&r: the side bays with blue glyphs.",
    "- &aEnergy&r: the side bays with green glyphs.",
    "",
    "{@pagebreak}",
    "Right-click it, pick a quest, and pipe in what it asks for. Everything that goes in is used up, and anything the task doesn't need is refused. Press &aLaunch&r once a quest has all its parts.",
    "",
    "The five quest paths can be split between players. Each phase gate below them unlocks the next tier of Fabricator recipes once every quest above it is done.",
  ],
  "quest.337013B1E6098B0F.quest_desc": [
    "The &aStellar Chart&r needs parts from the Moon and two new power sinks.",
    "",
    "- &aFortron&r: an &eMFFS&r &2Coercion Deriver&r turns power into it.",
    "- &aUltradense Antimatter&r: an &eFTB Industrial Contraptions&r &2Compressor&r packs 64 Antimatter into one.",
  ],
  "quest.2754B03A1C3C9790.title": "&9Fuel Core",
  "quest.57A4691609E10D24.title": "&5Continuing Tribute",
}